#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:10
msgid "I2C messages, target exchanges and bus recovery"
msgstr "I2C 消息、目标交换与总线恢复"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:12
msgid ""
"The endpoint owns its selected address and provider limits. Message "
"construction, request preparation and hardware admission are separate "
"operations; accepted descriptors and payloads remain borrowed until acquire-"
"observed SETTLED."
msgstr ""
"端点拥有选定地址及 provider 限制。消息构造、请求准备和硬件准入是独立操作；已接受描述符及负载在以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED "
"前持续借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:17
msgid ""
"I2C master descriptors use `nx_i2c_message_write()` for immutable TX and "
"`nx_i2c_message_read()` for writable RX, without adding a second payload "
"pointer. Construction performs no admission, allocation or payload access; "
"prepare and provider admission still validate spans, limits and ownership. "
"Rebuild a descriptor to change direction instead of changing `read` alone; "
"the selected union member must match its direction. Accepted descriptors and"
" payloads remain borrowed until acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr ""
"I2C master 描述符使用 `nx_i2c_message_write()` 绑定不可变 TX，使用 "
"`nx_i2c_message_read()` 绑定可写 RX，不增加第二个 payload 指针。构造不执行准入、分配或 payload "
"访问；prepare 与 provider 准入仍校验存储跨度、限额和所有权。切换方向时应重新构造描述符，不单独修改 `read`；所选 union "
"成员必须与方向一致。已接纳描述符和 payload 持续借用，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:25
msgid ""
"I2C request preparation validates message grammar and storage; selected "
"providers apply explicit `nx_i2c_limits_t` admission budgets. The maintained"
" bounded profile remains eight messages of at most 256 bytes each, with a "
"2048-byte total. A legal descriptor is not permission to exceed that "
"profile. There is no separate long-transfer engine, implicit splitting or "
"mode fallback."
msgstr ""
"I2C 请求准备验证消息语法与存储；所选 provider 使用明确的 `nx_i2c_limits_t` 准入预算。维护的有界 profile "
"仍为至多八条消息，每条至多 256 字节，总计 2048 字节。描述符合法不授予超出该 profile 的权限。没有独立长传输引擎、隐式拆分或模式回退。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:31
msgid ""
"I2C target exchanges use `i2c_target.h` and borrow complete bounded "
"requests. WRITE_READ supplies a precomputed response across one repeated "
"START. The [F407 target contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/i2c/README-target.md) defines own "
"addresses, optional PEC/ARA, IRQ latency and full drain. Product command "
"tables, ARP and Host Notify remain external."
msgstr ""
"I2C target 交换通过 `i2c_target.h` 借用完整的有界请求。WRITE_READ 通过一次 repeated "
"START，在接收后发送预计算响应。[F407 target 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/i2c/README-target.md)定义自身地址、可选 PEC／ARA、IRQ "
"延迟与完整排空。产品命令表、ARP 和 Host Notify 仍由外部提供。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:36
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:38
msgid "i2c.h"
msgstr "i2c.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/i2c.md:40
msgid "Address endpoints, repeated START and explicit STOP settlement."
msgstr "地址端点、重复 START 与显式 STOP 结清。"

